  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support combi-track missions, visits and events</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands embassy in Dhaka, Bangladesh and the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) are working on the implementation of two combi-tracks in Bangladesh: &apos;Sustainable horticulture&apos; and &apos;Circular RMG production for a sustainable future&apos;. Within these two combi-tracks different incoming (scoping) mission/visits and events will be organised.The primary objective of this project is to enhance the quality and efficiency of these visits/missions/events by contracting a trusted local partner who will assist in planning, organising, and executing the logistics required for these visits via the Netherlands embassy in Dhaka, Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
